      "content": "i know i'm \"safe\" in terms of not being in immediate danger, but it doesn't feel like it. it's just this constant, crushing pressure. like, i'm just a machine that exists to provide, to clean, to care, to exist for everyone else. i don't even know who i am anymore. i just want everything to stop. i just want some kind of peace where i don't have to feel this responsibility anymore.",
